cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SHELF, please cite the dataset and the paper."
title: "SHELF: A Synthetic Harness for Multi-Task Bibliographic Benchmarking"
abstract: >-
  A benchmark for bibliographic classification built from 62,899
  model-written documents labelled with Library of Congress classes and
  genre terms, with a factorial slice that varies subject, genre, audience
  and writing conditions independently.
type: dataset
license: CC-BY-4.0
authors:
